      "facts": [
        "Earth's Moon is the fifth-largest natural satellite in the Solar System and the largest relative to its parent planet (~27% of Earth's diameter).",
        "Synchronous rotation keeps the same lunar hemisphere facing Earth at all times as it orbits every 27.3 days (29.5-day synodic phase cycle).",
        "Its surface features dark basaltic maria (ancient volcanic plains) and bright, heavily cratered feldspathic highlands."
      ]
    },
